Start of Every Project. 

Folder Name/
├── venv/                   # ← ignored in .gitignore
├── requirements.txt        # ← very important! - Holds all of the Installed LIBS
├── .gitignore
├── main.py                # main script that calls modules
├── core/                  # base code
├── modules/               # different paperwork modules
├── templates/             # jinja2 or docx templates
├── output/                # generated PDFs, Excel, etc.
└── data/                  # input files (racks, connections, etc.)


